This book contains pictures of savagely looking people in loincloths. According to it, the inhabitants of this island are quite savage people. They live in small tribes and know what fire is, but they can't make it themselves. Each tribe carries fire in a wicker and worships it like an idol. The loss of fire is a great misfortune for these people. They communicate mainly through gestures.

You keep turning the pages, but soon it bores you. You may need to look for something else.